<title>POLAND: AMERBANK MAR NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK MAR NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.71 vs    0.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.10 vs    1.05</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.13 vs    3.03</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.94 vs    4.09</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  2.35 vs    1.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.83 vs    2.71</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 12.54 vs    8.85</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	16.36 vs   11.94</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Amerykanski w</p>
<p>Polsce Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
